# 换行符约定：Windows 脚本必须 CRLF，macOS 脚本必须 LF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.command text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf

# 文本文件统一 LF
*.py text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf

# 二进制
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.onnx binary
*.zip binary
*.db binary
